{
  "slug": "eloverblik",
  "name": "Eloverblik",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Read your Danish electricity metering data from ElOverblik (eloverblik.dk) — list meters, fetch hourly consumption, tariffs, charges, meter readings, and metering-point details. Unofficial; uses your personal ElOverblik refresh token (stored in your OS keychain).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `eloverblik`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install eloverblik@claude-community` from `maziarzamani/eloverblik-mcp`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that lets Claude read your Danish electricity metering data from ElOverblik (Energinet's customer data platform).",
